│                          │ square packings are strongly affected by which row contains the extra circle and by       │
│                          │ boundary contacts; the best solution is generally not reached from one perfectly          │
│                          │ symmetric seed. Every candidate is explicitly checked against all border and pairwise     │
│                          │ constraints before selection, retaining the existing final numerical safety scaling. This │
│                          │ is the successful strategy indicated by the stronger prior constructor while remaining    │
