│                          │ reliable, allowing the existing diverse asymmetric hexagonal seeds to converge more       │
│                          │ accurately within the evaluator time budget. Pair constraints retain Euclidean distance   │
│                          │ rather than squared distance, so their scale remains well conditioned near the active     │
│                          │ tangencies that define the packing.                                                       │
